<surname>Lee</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name><name><surname>Ordija</surname><given-names>CM</given-names></name><name><surname>Dowley</surname><given-names>NE</given-names></name><name><surname>Golenbock</surname><given-names>DT</given-names></name><name><surname>Freeman</surname><given-names>MW</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The induction of macrophage gene expression by LPS predominantly utilizes Myd88-independent signaling cascades</article-title><source>Physiological Genomics</source><year>2005</year><volume>19</volume><fpage>319</fpage><lpage>330</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1152/physiolgenomics.00128.2004</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>